{#
  祈愿 —— plugin/kokuu-lottery

  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  2026-11-03 v4（第三次重做，用户明确纠正方向）
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  用户原话：「虽然是 mc，但是太像素化了，与本站风格完全不搭，
  我要的是图片 mc，这个整体风格肯定还是偏向站点的原神的」

  → 关键理解修正：
     · 「图片 MC」= 用真实 MC 场景截图做背景，不要程序生成的像素块
     · 「偏向站点的原神」= 精致、克制、大留白、细腻阴影（Apple 扁平），
       不是粗描边、硬阴影、像素网格那套复古游戏 UI

  v3 的错误：把「MC 风格」理解成了「复古像素风 GUI」
  v4 的正确方向：
     · 背景：真实 MC 场景图（复用 appearance 的 6 张 512×512）
     · 质感：完全复用站点 tokens.css（品牌紫 / 青 / 淡紫、大圆角、
       柔和阴影、大留白）—— 与原神祈愿界面同源的精致感
     · 层次：图片做底 + 玻璃拟态面板 + 细腻光晕
     · 只保留「MC」在内核：场景图本身、物品图标用 MC 素材
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#}

{% extends 'user.base.twig' %}

{% block title %}祈愿{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
{% set d = lottery %}

<div class="ly-page" id="ly-page" data-url="{{ d.drawUrl }}" data-cost="{{ d.cost }}">

  {# ============ 顶部资源条（玻璃拟态）============ #}
  <div class="ly-res">
    <div class="ly-res-item">
      <span class="ly-res-ico ly-res-ico--gold"></span>
      <div class="ly-res-body">
        <span class="ly-res-num" id="ly-gold">{{ d.spendable }}</span>
        <span class="ly-res-label">金粒</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ly-res-div"></div>
    <div class="ly-res-item">
      <span class="ly-res-ico ly-res-ico--diamond"></span>
      <div class="ly-res-body">
        <span class="ly-res-num" id="ly-diamond">{{ d.diamond }}</span>
        <span class="ly-res-label">钻石</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ly-res-div"></div>
    <div class="ly-res-item">
      <span class="ly-res-ico ly-res-ico--emerald"></span>
      <div class="ly-res-body">
        <span class="ly-res-num" id="ly-emerald">{{ d.emerald }}</span>
        <span class="ly-res-label">绿宝石</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============ 卡池主视觉 ============ #}
  <div class="ly-pool" id="ly-pool">
    {# 真实 MC 场景轮播（多层交叉淡入） #}
    <div class="ly-pool-scenes" id="ly-scenes">
      <div class="ly-pool-scene" data-i="0"></div>
      <div class="ly-pool-scene" data-i="1"></div>
      <div class="ly-pool-scene" data-i="2"></div>
      <div class="ly-pool-scene" data-i="3"></div>
      <div class="ly-pool-scene" data-i="4"></div>
      <div class="ly-pool-scene" data-i="5"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ly-pool-veil"></div>

    <div class="ly-pool-content">
      <div class="ly-pool-badge">限时祈愿</div>
      <h2 class="ly-pool-title">像素秘藏</h2>
      <p class="ly-pool-desc">以金粒祈愿，得钻石与绿宝石</p>

      <div class="ly-pool-dots" id="ly-dots" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>

    {# 品质展示（右下角，玻璃胶囊） #}
    <div class="ly-pool-grades">
      <span class="ly-grade ly-grade--gold">
        <i class="ly-grade-ico ly-res-ico--emerald"></i>绿宝石
      </span>
      <span class="ly-grade ly-grade--purple">
        <i class="ly-grade-ico ly-res-ico--diamond"></i>钻石
      </span>
      <span class="ly-grade ly-grade--blue">
        <i class="ly-grade-ico ly-res-ico--gold"></i>金粒
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============ 保底进度（独立卡片，清晰易读）============ #}
  <div class="ly-pity">
    <div class="ly-pity-row">
      <span class="ly-pity-name">稀有保底</span>
      <div class="ly-pity-track">
        <div class="ly-pity-fill ly-pity-fill--purple"
             style="width: {{ d.pityPurple > 0 ? (d.sincePurple / d.pityPurple * 100) : 0 }}%"></div>
      </div>
      <span class="ly-pity-left">{{ d.pityPurple - d.sincePurple }} 抽</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ly-pity-row">
      <span class="ly-pity-name">传说保底</span>
      <div class="ly-pity-track">
        <div class="ly-pity-fill ly-pity-fill--gold"
             style="width: {{ d.pityGold > 0 ? (d.sinceGold / d.pityGold * 100) : 0 }}%"></div>
      </div>
      <span class="ly-pity-left">{{ d.pityGold - d.sinceGold }} 抽</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============ 操作按钮 ============ #}
  <div class="ly-actions">
    <button type="button" class="ly-btn ly-btn--one" id="ly-draw1"
            {% if not d.canDraw %}disabled{% endif %}>
      <span class="ly-btn-label">祈愿 1 次</span>
      <span class="ly-btn-price">
        <i class="ly-btn-ico ly-res-ico--gold"></i>{{ d.cost }}
      </span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="ly-btn ly-btn--ten" id="ly-draw10"
            {% if not d.canTen %}disabled{% endif %}>
      <span class="ly-btn-label">祈愿 10 次</span>
      <span class="ly-btn-price">
        <i class="ly-btn-ico ly-res-ico--gold"></i>{{ d.cost * 10 }}
      </span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <p class="ly-hint" id="ly-hint">
    {% if not d.canDraw %}
      金粒不足，无法祈愿
    {% else %}
      每 {{ d.pityPurple }} 抽必得稀有 · 每 {{ d.pityGold }} 抽必得传说
    {% endif %}
  </p>

  <div class="ly-result" id="ly-result" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>

  {# ============ 最近祈愿 ============ #}
  <section class="ly-history">
    <header class="ly-history-head">
      <span class="ly-history-title">最近祈愿</span>
      {% if myDraws is not empty %}
        <span class="ly-history-sub">共 {{ myDraws|length }} 条</span>
      {% endif %}
    </header>
    {% if myDraws is not empty %}
      <ul class="ly-history-list">
        {% for r in myDraws|slice(0, 12) %}
          <li class="ly-history-item">
            <span class="ly-history-dot ly-history-dot--{{ r.rarity }}"></span>
            <span class="ly-history-name">{{ r.prize_label }}</span>
            <span class="ly-history-time">{{ r.created_at|slice(5, 11) }}</span>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% else %}
      <div class="ly-history-empty">还没有祈愿记录</div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
</div>
{% endblock %}

{% block before_foot %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url('/plugins/kokuu-lottery/assets/lottery.css') }}?v=4.0.1">

{#
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  🎬 祈愿动画层（原神式：暗场 → 光爆 → 逐张揭晓）
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  质感与站点一致：柔和光晕、大圆角卡片、细腻阴影，
  不用硬描边/像素网格。
  ⚠️ 默认 hidden，仅 .is-on 显示，否则永久挡住点击
  ⚠️ 总时长与 lottery.js 常量对齐
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#}
<div class="ly-anim" id="ly-anim" hidden aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="ly-anim-veil"></div>
  <div class="ly-anim-glow"></div>
  <div class="ly-anim-ring"></div>

  <div class="ly-cards" id="ly-cards"></div>

  <button type="button" class="ly-skip" id="ly-skip">跳过</button>
</div>

<script>
  window.LY_CSRF = (function () {
    var m = document.cookie.match(/(?:^|;\s*)XSRF-TOKEN=([^;]+)/);
    return m ? decodeURIComponent(m[1]) : '';
  })();
</script>
<script src="{{ url('/plugins/kokuu-lottery/assets/lottery.js') }}?v=4.0.1"></script>
{% endblock %}

